.Dd August 29, 2026
.Dt FSCK_EXT2FS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm fsck_ext2fs
.Nd check ext2 file system consistency
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl Cdfnpy
.Op Fl b Ar number
.Ar filesys | device
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility checks and reports ext2 file system consistency.
This version is a read-only checker: it detects problems but does not
repair them.
It is the ext2 counterpart of
.Xr fsck_ffs 8 .
.Pp
If
.Fl b
is specified, the superblock at the given block is used.
The block numbers are printed by
.Xr newfs_ext2fs 8 .
.Pp
If
.Fl f
is specified, the file system is checked even when marked clean.
.Pp
If
.Fl p
is specified, the file system is preened: clean file systems are
skipped.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ext2fs 4 ,
.Xr fsck_ffs 8 ,
.Xr newfs_ext2fs 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
utility is currently under development and has not yet been released.
